# Makefile for the linux memory manager.
#

# The kernel tree builds mm/zsmalloc.ko itself (CONFIG_ZSMALLOC=m). The
# device modules tree carries the mtk patched copy, but an external module
# cannot replace it: both export the same symbols, so only one can load and
# the one that matches the kernel source is the kernel's.
# obj-$(CONFIG_ZSMALLOC)  += zsmalloc.o

